    },
    {
      "function_name": "businessTools",
      "description": "Openingsuren + open-status (getOpeningHours), events of gastenreviews (getReviews) per vestiging."
    },
    {
      "function_name": "memoryTools",
      "description": "Shared Guest Profile \u2014 ONE profile across the website host and the voice host. MANDATORY: call getGuestProfile with the visitor_id on the very first message of every conversation, before replying \u2014 every time, no exceptions. Actions:\n- getGuestProfile: returns { profile, preferences, is_returning }. Always call this first, every conversation.\n- requestConsent { granted: true|false }: record the guest's consent decision before storing personal preferences (not required for the name itself).\n- updateIdentity { first_name?, last_name?, preferred_name?, preferred_language?, email? }: store identity the guest shared \u2014 call this the same turn the guest gives their name.\n- setPreference { key, value, consent_granted, inferred?, category? }: store a preference. Use consent_granted:true when the guest agreed. inferred:true for AI-observed patterns (confidence grows with repetition); inferred:false (default) for explicit guest statements \u2014 explicit ALWAYS overrides inferred.\n- addInsight { insight, confidence? }: store an AI-inferred insight (e.g. \"frequently chooses beef\").\n- recordBehaviour { preferred_time?, typical_party_size?, last_topic?, last_channel?, reservation? }: track hospitality behaviour; set last_topic so the next conversation can resume.\n- forget { key? }: remove a preference (or all).\nPreference keys: favorite_dish, favorite_dessert, favorite_drink, favorite_wine, meat_doneness, favorite_sauce, dietary, allergens, dislikes, favorite_seasonal, preferred_location. Pass the silent visitor_id (from the [ctx:] block) on every call. Never store personal preferences without consent."
    },
    {
      "function_name": "contextTools",
      "description": "Real-time contextsnapshot (profiel, recente events, locatie open-status) om de gastheer te laten redeneren."
    },
    {
      "function_name": "analyticsTools",
      "description": "Een gestructureerd event loggen of een metriek (count) opvragen."
    },
    {
      "function_name": "assetSearch",
      "description": "Doorzoek de Bog\u00e8st-beeldbank naar echte foto's (interieur, gerechten, sfeer, architectuur, branding) per categorie/locatie/zoekterm. Parameters: { query, category (interiors|gastronomy|atmosphere|architecture|branding), location (hasselt|borgloon|heusden-zolder), limit }. Geeft { count, images: [{url, description, category, subcategory, location, tags, matched_dish}] }. Toon foto's via [UIACTION:showDishPhoto|query|category|location] (opent het foto-paneel dat van rechts binnenkomt, nooit in de chat) en gebruik enkel URL's uit de tool-uitvoer \u2014 verzin nooit URL's. Toon alleen een foto als de match duidelijk relevant is; geen foto is beter dan een foute foto."
    }
  ],
